(7695869, 1261986, 173844, '<td valign="top">Clever, funny, artful and beautifully pulled off.  Black and white old-fashioned feel, and I even like the tattered framing.  Can''t see the entire enclosure, but the penguins don''t look to have much joy.<br/>In any case, personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Clever, funny, artful and beautifully pulled off.  Black and white old-fashioned feel, and I even like the tattered framing.  Can''t see the entire enclosure, but the penguins don''t look to have much joy.In any case, personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-06-11 00:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
