(7695872, 1261764, 173844, '<td valign="top">Pyramids, skyscrapers, palms and a spooky window --  what more can you ask for?  Bizarre, mystifying and entrancing.  Is it Las Vegas?  Life has certainly shifted a few inches for me.  Fabulous.</td>', 'Pyramids, skyscrapers, palms and a spooky window --  what more can you ask for?  Bizarre, mystifying and entrancing.  Is it Las Vegas?  Life has certainly shifted a few inches for me.  Fabulous.', '2021-06-11 00:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
